sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: UnlockConnectorRequest (evseId, connectorId)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message UnlockConnectorRequest<br>- evseId = <Configured evseId><br>- connectorId = <Configured connectorId>

    CS-->>CSMS: UnlockConnectorResponse (status = Unlocked)
